<title>USA: Viasystems Group to buy Ericsson unit.</title>
<headline>Viasystems Group to buy Ericsson unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telefon AB L.M. Ericsson and Viasystems Group Inc said Wednesday they have signed a letter of intent for Viasystems to buy Ericsson's printed circuit board production unit in Norrkoping, Sweden.</p>
<p>The letter of intent will serve as the basis for further negotiations, the companies said in a joint release.</p>
<p>The facility employs about 350 people, they said. Other terms were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
